// The strongroom keeper in Vettius's house: a slave who sits against the
// door. The way past him is the door itself (cab_strongroom).
=== start
[flag house_factor] -> factor
The big man on the stool against the strongroom door looks at you with no interest at all.

"Master's room," he says. "Not yours."
* [speech 30] "Where are you from?" -> where
* "Fine." -> END

=== where
He thinks about not answering. "Matisco. Downriver." He looks at his hands, which are a smith's hands with nothing to do. "Long time ago."
* "Fine." -> END

=== factor
He gets up off the stool for you, now. It doesn't look as if he likes it.
* "Sit down." -> END
